{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261112/photo/bkn-20261112095136947-1112_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261112095813\"/><p>赤柱正灘泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（11月12日）宣布，由於大浪關係，港島南區的赤柱正灘泳灘及大浪灣泳灘；以及西貢區的銀線灣泳灘及清水灣第二灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該4處游泳會有危險，市民請勿在該4處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T02:07:17.954158+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T01:51:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T05:57:20.714959+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T02:00:49.649478+00:00","content_hash":"f64b207c7091b2c3adffbd65beccf5f1347e20ade876b7ac840cea3a24282326","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}